START
  ↓
Display Store Menu
  ↓
User selects product
  ↓
Is input valid?
  ├── NO → Show "Invalid input" → Back to Menu
  └── YES ↓
Check if product is out of stock
  ├── YES → Show "Out of stock" → Back to Menu
  └── NO ↓
User enters quantity
  ↓
Is quantity valid?
  ├── NO → Show "Invalid quantity" → Back to Menu
  └── YES ↓
Enough stock?
  ├── NO → Show "Not enough stock" → Back to Menu
  └── YES ↓
Add/Update item in cart
  ↓
Deduct stock
  ↓
Add more items?
  ├── YES → Back to Menu
  └── NO ↓
Compute total
  ↓
Is total ≥ 5000?
  ├── YES → Apply 10% discount
  └── NO ↓
Display receipt + final total
  ↓
Show updated stock
  ↓
END
